To be eligible to enter and compete in the Championship , each Competitor must:

Have had their Registration Application Form unconditionally accepted by PCA;

Be registered with the CM ;

Hold a valid Competition Licence acceptable to Motorsport Australia , and

Accept and comply with all terms and conditions of the 2026 Porsche Carrera Cup Australia Commercial Agreement (Commercial Agreement) as published by the CM .

